        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ata ringmei thingbang tisulou o",
            "Duithuak khuang khou thaumei thingbang kumna",
            "Kaman zanga kabuan ringmei buan khang",
            "Bumaeng taan thaimei mbu thaudiu khang",
            "",
            "Suthanlou o, aniu guay lungning hei",
            "Timaan lou o reinung lungning guay tei",
            "Lungning gaimei kumcna gaibam diu khang",
            "Heiramc gaimei khoutei ai guang tang khang.",
            "",
            "2. Ringchang punide rianra bam sini",
            "Jisu lim bang khoutei ringmei nai e",
            "Ravguangc rui liuloumei bang theidat mak",
            "Hei kandi tei amaanc datzat lak khe.",
            "",
            "3. Ringhsaan ryanra ryanriu na bam sini",
            "Ravguangc piirunh runv puinung guang diu khang",
            "Khoutei guang khang Jisu rui kau bam e",
            "Mbaan thaimei tingkau khou guangdiu khang."
          ]
        }
      }
